== 7. the generation question: is (path, version) a stable name?
   life 1: [(2, '31356d60')]  entry_id: 01M5PV1V3CVXDC7TC6F35QYTP0
delete /g.md                                 ok=True  errs=[] rows=[('/g.md', 'deleted', 2)]
write /g.md (revive)                         ok=True  errs=[] rows=[('/g.md', 'updated', 4)]
   revived: [(4, '5f0ade17')]  same entry_id: True
sweep /g.md (purge)                          ok=True  errs=[] rows=[('/g.md', 'deleted', 5)]
write /g.md 'third life'                     ok=True  errs=[] rows=[('/g.md', 'created', 1)]
   after sweep+create: [(1, '1de93280')]  same entry_id: False
   rename then create at old path: /h.md [(1, 'd9298a10')]  /h2.md [(2, '3bfc2695')]

